1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
A certificate alone is no longer enough for modern international Halal trade.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
AMANAH connects standards, evidence and authority boundaries without replacing competent authorities.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:17,000
From China origin, organisations, facilities, products and suppliers become attributable evidence objects.

4
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Laboratory results and smart audits strengthen the assurance case. They do not certify by themselves.

5
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:31,000
AI assists. Authorised humans and competent authority decide.

6
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:39,000
Production and logistics events are bound to custody, condition and exception controls.

7
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Importer, distributor, retailer and buyer all verify the right scope and state.

8
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:55,000
Consumers see approved verification fields, while the command centre can contain exceptions and recalls.

9
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Evidence before trust. Trust before operational release.
